\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces Post hoc geometric assignment diagnostic. Points show failure means for every naming condition; intervals are exploratory crossed-person/seed 95\% intervals over 14 people and three seeds. Each estimates its method mean, not a pairwise effect. Failure combines wrong, ambiguous, and missing predictions on separately eligible bilateral hip/knee/ankle pairs. Endpoint strata retain the executed 4:1 nonheld/held weighting. All estimators, cameras, physical orientations, and observation conditions are pooled. Direct uses joint coordinate fitting; endpoint and delta use frozen encoders and the original change readout. No categorical lines or chance baseline are implied.}}{9}{figure.5}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:laterality}{{5}{9}{Post hoc geometric assignment diagnostic. Points show failure means for every naming condition; intervals are exploratory crossed-person/seed 95\% intervals over 14 people and three seeds. Each estimates its method mean, not a pairwise effect. Failure combines wrong, ambiguous, and missing predictions on separately eligible bilateral hip/knee/ankle pairs. Endpoint strata retain the executed 4:1 nonheld/held weighting. All estimators, cameras, physical orientations, and observation conditions are pooled. Direct uses joint coordinate fitting; endpoint and delta use frozen encoders and the original change readout. No categorical lines or chance baseline are implied}{figure.5}{}}
